  "term": "characteristic",
  "definition": "A characteristic is a distinctive trait or quality that marks an individual, or sometimes a class or group, as different from others. In art and aesthetics, it also means a portrayal that clearly and truthfully brings out the most important distinguishing features of a person, object, or action.",
